A||||12||1FST2M6||Hey Moo.. about your CRX... :) ||||1||
Z||000000||1FST2M6||03-23-2000||11:58 PM||||OK there is a car gathering every thursday night at a local 3ac. Parking lot (Mall). About 600 people and about 200 cars Everything from Jumping Biscaynes to the dork in a cut spring slammed Diesel Rabbit. I'm not kidding.. Well I took my Nitrous off the car a few days ago, well the bottle out anyway.. . Starting the fabrication for the S/C and needed knee room. There is a Kid with a.. yep you guessed it 91 CRX SI I didn't know anything about his car.. other than it had stickers all over it a LAME wing and 16" wheels tucked up in the wheel well. He's giving me a hard time.. " That Fiero sucks, You don't act all big and Bad with out your nitrous" well cause I don't pick fights with Moosetangs now, yeah ok you got me... Just kinda blew him off and went to find some friends... Got tired and My girlfriend and I decided to split.. I and about 5 other friends (S/C Corolla, NOS Civic and such) all caravaned to Coffee shop about 5 miles down the road.. I'm leading the pack.. Just the unlucky one i guess...   Well upon stopping at the 3rd light the SAME lame CRX big headed kid meets me at the stop light Tachs his toy up and wants to play.. ok I'm Game. There are about 15 people watching in the surrounding stopped traffic.   Other light turns yellow I'm at 1300 hes at god knows what, WAY to high. light drops Red Girlfriend puts her head back and says " $%^T here we go again" ours turns green Dump my clutch I'm pulling Hard light em up in 2nd and Lyndsay says " kill it! "  Look down I'm at about 82 just in to 3rd when she said that my stomach dropped thinkin' I'm going to jail when I look back I'm about 6 car lenghts ahead of him and he ducks out in to an industrial Park. "Well that was a waste of gas..." Girlfriend says 20 minutes later.. at the coffee shop he rolls by I and few friends approach him..  he has a STOCK motor with 103K, Header, intake, Tanabe Cat back and stock jets in his yep NITROUS! He couldn't hook up.. All the HP in the world won't do you a bit of good if you've got no traction. Civics and FWD cars all suffer from the same problem.. weight transfer... the Fiero uses this to it's advantage. Just another Notch on my Firewall and another Kid thinking he's all cool with the bottle, shot down in flames... Oh yeah Street Racing is Illegal and you WILL loose you liscense IF you get caught... Don't street race...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> VIVA LA FIERO!<p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 03-24-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||mwbackus||03-24-2000||01:08 AM||||Ya, you very well could loose your license, but I would be a little more concerned with the safety of my girlfriend than the loss of a stupid drivers license.  Lives are much harder to replace... If you insist on driving like an idiot, at least do it alone! There is absolutly no excuse for risking the lifes of innocent people, just to get your own rocks off!<P>Mike||||reg||8
Z||000002||Dan86gt3.8||03-24-2000||01:09 AM||||Good kill.  I can't stand ricer punks.  Like the idot who told me to "take my $h!t home". Ohhh ya he wouldnever slow down and race, he would only do the classic fly by.  Seems like alott of talk in the parking lot, but when you hit the streets they can't back it up, hmmm strange happens a lot.  Always some kind of problem like my tip wasn't big enough or my super wing wasn't giving me enough down force ( you know over the rear wheels, ie- the ones that are the driving wheels, which are almost always ther rear ones on ricers, or is it the other way around who knows)  just glad to see another over cocky full of bs ricer go down in flames.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Dan86gt3.8||03-24-2000||01:13 AM||||hey mawbuscks, settle down.  There is no way everyone willstop street racing.  I do it all the time, I also race karts(which is a "safe environment"), but still there is a possibility of getting hurt, just like you could get in a head on collision on the freeway tomorow when you go to work.  If racing is in you its gona take over.  Just my .02.||||reg||1
Z||000004||mwbackus||03-24-2000||01:32 AM||||Racing between two willing participants on a deserted road is one thing, but endangering the life of your passenger who has no choice in the matter is just not cool!  Probably scared the $hit out of the poor kid, just to get his own thrill.  Too bad the girls father didnt get to observe that little display of carelessness..<p>[This message has been edited by mwbackus (edited 03-24-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||1FST2M6||03-24-2000||08:17 AM||||Shes more annoyed at the kid in the CRX that thinks he has a chance, than scared of me and my driving efforts. She does the same thing when driving all our cars..(Fiero, Alfa 164 and her Saturn)  Her Saturn has MANY go fast mods too.. Have you ever heard of "Girlie Girl Racing" they are an all Female car club with members and chapters all over the US. She is the Treasurer of the Atlanta Chapter...As for her DAD.. He knows whats going on.. I've raced his Big Block Convertable Chevelle at just about the same light with him driving and her in my car... I'm gunna get off that subject before anyone else gets mad... <BR>Kids talkin' crap and not putting up anything are how the Ricers got their gimp image. Not being affraid of loosing is what gives the rest of us the upper hand, not scared and they know it... but their not really sure why. And what is up with that LAME fly-by!?! Just so i can hear his fart can? OOOh i'm impressed... Hey kid.. sell it and by somthing fast!   Like a FIERO!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
